# 56. State Ownership Rules

| State | Owner |
|---|---|
| Project canonical data | Backend |
| Task canonical data | Backend |
| Milestone canonical data | Backend |
| Risk canonical data | Backend |
| User identity | Auth/backend |
| Permissions | Backend-derived |
| API cache | Frontend |
| Modal state | Component/UI |
| Sidebar state | UI |
| Form draft | Form |
| SSE connection | Infrastructure |
| AI execution truth | Backend |
| AI execution display | Frontend |
