# 95. Phase 03 Freeze Statement

Phase 03 establishes the structural architecture of the GrowFlow frontend.

The frontend is defined as:

```text
One application
        ↓
One shared shell
        ↓
BUILD / SUPERVISE / GOVERN experiences
        ↓
Domain-oriented frontend capabilities
        ↓
Separate Server / UI / Streaming state
        ↓
Centralized REST / SSE / Auth infrastructure
        ↓
FastAPI backend
```

The frontend is a presentation and interaction layer over canonical backend state.

It does not own:

- database truth
- authorization truth
- AI execution truth
- analytics truth
- RAG truth
- persistent workflow truth

Long-running AI and processing workflows survive navigation and browser lifecycle because execution is persistent on the backend.

The architecture is designed to support the complete Phase 01 page inventory and Phase 02 navigation model without requiring separate role applications or duplicated infrastructure.

